                                "example_id": "b7e57f6f-b2ef-4e4a-8a30-68d368ba3a91",
                                "sense_id": "ba28f1ea-aca6-3dc1-a3b9-0b03d69c2303",
                                "text": "Thorofare planning is closely interwoven …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4a3773e7-3188-4e7f-9823-79fdfdf5c02a",
                                "sense_id": "ba28f1ea-aca6-3dc1-a3b9-0b03d69c2303",
                                "text": "From Jericho Bay, it's possible to take either the Eggemoggin Reach to the N, or the Deer Island Thorofare to the S. … There are 2 well-marked channels into Deer Island Thorofare."
